rebot.glb and rebot.joints.json are converted from Seeed Studio's reBot Arm B601-DM description
(https://github.com/Seeed-Projects/reBot-DevArm, Rebot_Arm_description/DM, commit
c16d03eaa31a2a1c0bb38b20423d60818f2a3665): two arms, the visual meshes as upstream, decimated and merged per link
and colour, placed in the frames of dream's b601_dm.urdf (the base meshes 45 mm lower, link6, the gripper and the
fingers turned half a turn about x, the fingers about their slide axis). Modified 2026-11-13 by Dream Labs.

Hardware design (c) 2026 Seeed Studio Co., Ltd. (SeeedStudio), licensed under the CERN Open Hardware Licence
Version 2 - Weakly Reciprocal (CERN-OHL-W-2.0); the full text is LICENSE-CERN-OHL-W-2.0 in this folder.

---

metal.glb and metal.joints.json are converted from MakerMods' Metal arm description
(https://github.com/makermods-robotics/metal-python-ros, metal_ros2/src/metal_description, commit
ef4181f1305cbcfc63431d3bcfb96f5fb7f72763): two arms, the meshes as upstream, merged per link and colour, the arm's
links drawn dark and the gripper in its own colours, placed in the frames of dream's metal.urdf (link6, the gripper and
the fingers turned so each turns or slides along its node's z). Modified 2026-11-16 by Dream Labs.

The meshes are (c) MakerMods. That repository carries no licence file; they are redistributed here with MakerMods'
permission.

---

maker.glb and maker.joints.json are converted from MakerMods' Maker Arm description
(https://github.com/makermods-robotics/maker-arm-sdk, urdf/maker_arm, commit b30d05a23d72e8c155a8e00f807aba8e8c705f68):
two arms, the meshes decimated and merged per link and colour, the arm's links drawn dark and the two jaws light, placed
in the frames of dream's maker_arm_ik.urdf (the base under its fixed z-up turn). Modified 2026-11-16 by Dream Labs.

The Maker Arm description is (c) MakerMods, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0; the full text is
LICENSE-Apache-2.0 in this folder.
